.TH RATASH-PROFILE 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.3" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-profile \- Add, list, activate, and remove subscription Profiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash profile\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add, list, activate, and remove subscription Profiles
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ratash\-profile\-add(1)
Download, validate, and save an HTTP(S) subscription
.TP
ratash\-profile\-list(1)
List saved Profiles and their refresh state
.TP
ratash\-profile\-use(1)
Activate a validated Profile Snapshot
.TP
ratash\-profile\-remove(1)
Remove an Inactive Profile
